---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import AboutVisual from "../components/AboutVisual.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="About LeadsFlo" description="LeadsFlo connects performance marketing, custom development and automation to help lead-driven businesses attract and convert qualified inquiries." path="/about/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">ABOUT LEADSFLO</p><h1>More than an ad agency. Built for the whole lead journey.</h1><p class="lf-lede">LeadsFlo focuses on one business problem: how to attract the right prospects and help more of them become customers. We combine creative strategy, paid acquisition, conversion-focused development and connected follow-up systems.</p><a href="/contact/" class="button button-primary">Tell us about your business <span>↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHAT DEFINES US</span><strong>Marketing thinking with the ability to build what the strategy requires.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<AboutVisual />
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">OUR FOCUS</p><h2>Specialized in outcomes. Flexible in execution.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Lead generation first</h3><p>Lead generation is our core specialty, but our website development and advertising experience also extends to e-commerce projects when the scope is a good fit.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Development when it matters</h3><p>We are not limited to a single page builder. Custom websites, integrations and software tools can be part of the solution when the project requires them.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Transparency over hype</h3><p>We prefer clear scopes, honest measurement and practical improvements over unsupported growth claims.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">WHO WE WORK WITH</p><h2>For businesses that grow through conversations.</h2></div><div class="lf-prose"><h3>Service businesses, professional teams and lead-driven organizations</h3><p>Our approach can fit local services, professional firms, education, home services and other businesses where an inquiry, consultation or appointment begins the buying journey.</p><h3>Not limited to one niche</h3><p>We adapt to the economics and sales process of each business. What stays consistent is the emphasis on qualified demand, clear conversion paths and reliable lead management.</p><h3>What we're not</h3><p>Lead generation remains our main focus, not our only capability. We also welcome conversations about e-commerce websites and ad campaigns, while keeping each project clearly scoped to the results it needs.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="lf-page-section lf-founder-visual" aria-labelledby="lf-founder-heading"><div class="container lf-founder-visual__grid"><div class="lf-founder-visual__photo"><img src="/work/founder-cary-wood.webp" alt="Cary Wood, founder of LeadsFlo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="lf-founder-visual__copy"><p class="section-kicker">MEET THE FOUNDER</p><h2 id="lf-founder-heading">Cary Wood. Marketing experience with a builder's mindset.</h2><p>With more than 13 years in sales and marketing, Cary combines campaign strategy with website development, conversion funnels, CRM workflows and custom software.</p><p>LeadsFlo connects those capabilities so each step—from the first click to the sales conversation—works together.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project ↗</a></div></div></section>
<style>.lf-founder-visual{background:#f3f6fc}.lf-founder-visual__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);align-items:center;gap:clamp(28px,6vw,90px)}.lf-founder-visual__photo{border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;max-width:460px;background:#e6ebf3}.lf-founder-visual__photo img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;max-height:560px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}.lf-founder-visual__copy h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3.5vw,48px);line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:14px 0 22px}.lf-founder-visual__copy p:not(.section-kicker){line-height:1.75;color:#516078;margin-bottom:18px}.lf-founder-visual__copy .button{margin-top:12px}@media(max-width:750px){.lf-founder-visual__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lf-founder-visual__photo{max-width:360px}}</style>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">START HERE</p><h2>Have a lead generation challenge worth solving?</h2></div><a href="/contact/" class="button button-primary">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>